---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "@components/ui/Container.astro";
import Badge from "@components/ui/Badge.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@components/seo/Breadcrumb.astro";

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: "About", url: "/about" }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us — Quick JPG Converter"
  description="Learn about Quick JPG Converter, a free privacy-first image conversion tool built for speed, simplicity, and complete data safety."
  canonical="https://quickjpgconverter.com/about"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <section class="section">
    <Container variant="narrow">
      <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbs} />

      <div class="mt-8">
        <Badge class="mb-4">About Us</Badge>
      </div>

      <article class="prose mt-6">
        <h1>About Quick JPG Converter</h1>

        <p class="lead">
          Quick JPG Converter is a free online tool designed to make image format
          conversion simple, fast, and completely private. Built for photographers,
          designers, developers, and anyone who needs quick image conversions
          without the hassle of desktop software.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <p>
          We provide a suite of free browser-based image conversion tools. Our core
          feature allows users to convert JPG images to PNG, WebP, and PDF formats
          instantly — with additional tools for converting PNG to JPG, WebP to JPG,
          and resizing images. Every conversion runs entirely in your browser using
          modern web technologies, meaning your files never leave your device.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you need a transparent logo in PNG, a lightweight image in WebP,
          or a quick PDF from a photo, our tools handle the job in milliseconds
          without requiring you to install anything or create an account.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          We believe image conversion should be accessible to everyone without
          compromising privacy. Too many online converters upload your files to
          remote servers, exposing personal photos and sensitive documents to
          unnecessary risk. We built Quick JPG Converter to solve this problem.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our goal is to provide the fastest, most private image conversion
          experience available on the web — completely free, with no hidden fees,
          no sign-up walls, and no data collection.
        </p>

        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike traditional converters that upload your images to a server, our
          tool uses modern browser APIs — including the Canvas API and WebAssembly —
          to process images directly on your device. This approach offers several
          important advantages:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Faster conversion</strong> — no upload or download wait times; processing happens locally</li>
          <li><strong>Complete privacy</strong> — images never leave your browser and are never transmitted to any server</li>
          <li><strong>No file size limits</strong> — constrained only by your device's available memory</li>
          <li><strong>No account required</strong> — open the site and start converting immediately</li>
          <li><strong>Works on any device</strong> — desktop, tablet, or phone with a modern browser</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why Choose Us</h2>
        <p>
          There are dozens of image converters online. Here's what sets Quick JPG
          Converter apart:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>100% free</strong> — no premium tiers, no paywalls, no hidden charges</li>
          <li><strong>Zero uploads</strong> — your files stay on your device at all times</li>
          <li><strong>Instant results</strong> — conversions complete in milliseconds</li>
          <li><strong>Batch support</strong> — convert multiple files simultaneously</li>
          <li><strong>Quality control</strong> — choose between high quality, balanced, or smallest file size</li>
          <li><strong>Mobile-friendly</strong> — works perfectly on phones and tablets</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Open and Transparent</h2>
        <p>
          Quick JPG Converter is built with transparency in mind. Our privacy
          policy clearly explains what data we collect (virtually none), and our
          terms of service are written in plain language. We welcome feedback,
          feature requests, and contributions from the community.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          We are committed to keeping this tool free and ad-supported. We do not
          sell user data, we do not require accounts, and we do not store your
          images. Our revenue comes solely from non-intrusive advertisements that
          help us cover hosting and development costs.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          Have a question, suggestion, or just want to say hello? We'd love to hear
          from you. Reach out to us at
          <a href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=supportquickjpgconverter@gmail.com">supportquickjpgconverter@gmail.com</a>
          or visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> for more options.
        </p>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
